          "code": "SUMMARY",
          "id": "SUMMARY",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "SUMMARY_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Transaction Activity Data:\n{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_DATA_V2.$output.result}}\n\nProvide a brief summary (2-3 sentences) of the transaction activity analysis:\n1. How many users were found in transaction controls?\n2. How many of those users also have access violations (correlated risk)?\n3. What is the highest risk level found?\n\nIf no data is available, state that the Transaction Data Generator workflow needs to be run first.\n\nKeep the summary concise for inclusion in a dashboard overview."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        }
